WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:07.730
Treasures

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.370
Treasures.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:07.730
Indispensable
Things

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.170
Indispensable things.

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:07.730
Precious 
Things

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.700
Precious things.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:15.490
It happened suddenly, on an ordinary day.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.750
Dazai-san and I...

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.010
<b>Dazai</b>

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.990
Swapped bodies!

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.020
<b>Episode 29</b>

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.020
<b>Swap 
Theater</b>

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.920
Oh, wind, what do you wish of me?

00:00:53.530 --> 00:01:02.660
<b>Dazai</b>

00:00:53.530 --> 00:01:02.660
<b>Atsushi</b>

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.290
Dazai-san?

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.070
Yup.

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.130
I'm going to go mess with Kunikida-kun!

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.130
Wait!

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.570
Please don't prank anyone!

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.670
Let's stay put until we're back to normal.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.650
Oh, all right.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:05.950
Fine.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:08.660
I just said to stay put! Please don't 
take my body out of the mortal coil!

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:12.800
<b>Ufufu</b>

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:12.010
Maybe I'll go hit on some beautiful ladies.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:13.150
Please don't!

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:15.810
If you can't stay put, 
could you at least do some work?

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.430
<b>Ideals</b>

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:21.270
Dazai is telling Atsushi to do work...

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:22.930
This is becoming a pain in the ass.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:24.910
Hey, Kunikida-kun!

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:27.020
I was just looking for you.

00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:28.680
Atsushi, that's you, right?

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.160
Oh, wind, what do you...

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.190
What the hell is this?!

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.200
<b>What
 the hell?!</b>

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:36.200
<b>Kunikida</b>

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.090
Yay! I have Kunikida-kun's body!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:42.990
<b>Dazai</b>

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:46.460
<b>Kunikida</b>

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:47.000
<b>Atsushi</b>

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.160
Well? How do I look?

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.970
Dazai Osamu in Kunikida-kun!

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.200
It's creepy.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.190
Yay! I'm going to go eat barbecue 
with Kunikida-kun's money!

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:47.700
Hold it!

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.630
Are you all right, Rampo-san?

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.080
My body...

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:55.090
I'm fine, but what was that for?

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.090
<b>Rampo</b>

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:55.960
<b>Dazai</b>

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:55.980
Oh, dear.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:06.230
<b>Kunikida</b>

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:06.230
<b>Atsushi</b>

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:06.230
<b>Rampo</b>

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:06.230
<b>Dazai</b>

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.520
Huh, me?

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:59.460
<i>They've swapped bodies, too.</i>

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:06.220
Rampo uses his Ultra Deduction to 
immediately grasp the situation.

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:07.460
This is so fun!

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.010
I'm going to go show the boss.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:10.280
Please don't do that!

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:11.730
That's Rampo-san for you.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.370
Oh, oh, wind...

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.940
You still don't look like him, Atsushi-kun.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.030
You have to seem more chill.

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:26.190
Smile more.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:27.580
I can't do this.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.180
I can't act like Dazai-san.

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:31.490
You were the one who said 
you couldn't be found out.

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:33.740
Or do you want to end up like him?

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.540
No, I'd rather not.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.990
I scare myself.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.010
<b>Kunikida buries himself
 in work to escape reality</b>

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:39.330
Rampo-san's being himself, too.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.500
Seeing Kunikida-kun like that scares me.

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:44.780
Why don't you just go back 
to your own bodies, then?

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:45.910
I can go back?

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:46.450
I can?!

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:47.760
Aww, we're going back?

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:51.710
You swapped when you bumped heads, 
so bump your heads again.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.030
Nice and simple.

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:58.310
Umm...

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.220
First, Kunikida-san and I switch back, then...

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:01.920
Hold it.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.930
Dazai, you go back first.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.850
You know I don't like pain.

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:08.040
This is getting complicated, huh?

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.040
Meow.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.040
<b>I am a...</b>

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.050
<b>Episode 30</b>

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.050
<b>My Treasure</b>

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.560
Time to eat.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.560
Time to eat.

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.080
It's good, huh?

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:24.700
Yeah.

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.870
Thanks for doing this all the time.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:27.510
Yeah.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.640
<b>Silence...</b>

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.560
Are you getting used to 
the Agency, Kyouka-chan?

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.460
I am.

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:35.410
Is there anything that's bothering you?

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:36.180
No.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.200
<i>I can't keep up a conversation with her.</i>

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.690
Thank you.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:43.450
<b>She was just 
enjoying her meal</b>

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.450
<i>That was delicious.</i>

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.630
Oh, good morning.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:47.960
Good morning.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:51.630
<i>I wonder if I'd be like 
this if I had a brother.</i>

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:49.820
What's up?

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.550
Oh, Onii-sama, you have 
a stain on your shirt.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.040
<b>Fwip</b>

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:57.580
Stop! W-We're in public, Naomi!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.730
I can't do that.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.720
Look, you have a stain here, too.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.850
Naomi!

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:04.410
<i>I don't think I would.</i>

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.780
Hanako Two. Morning.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.020
Hey, good morning.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.360
Sorry I'm talking to you from up here.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.810
Kunikida-san asked me to take this down.

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:20.360
I can't quite reach.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.110
Wow!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.360
City girls sure are impressive.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.870
Thank you!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.980
<i>Let's just leave it at that, then.</i>

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.520
Oh, perfect timing.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.700
Over here.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.130
<b>Sushi</b>

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.130
<b>Easy for Anyone!</b>

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:36.140
Here.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:40.800
You mix this suspicious powder in water 
and knead it, and it turns into sushi candy.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.060
Let's make some together!

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.130
<i>I don't know about this.</i>

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.260
Knead, knead, knead, knead...

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.090
The more you knead...

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.190
You passed the test.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.960
Done!

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:03.580
<i>Thank you, detective who 
sees through everything.</i>

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:07.890
This isn't even much of a wound.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:10.570
Don't be shy. I'll fix it up for you.

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:13.850
No, err... I just cut it on some documents.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:14.780
I'm fine.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.110
Don't you dare underestimate cuts.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:20.310
If it festers, you could end up
 having to amputate it.

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:22.590
You don't want tetanus, either.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:25.690
Please take care of it.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.430
That's more like it.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:31.820
<i>Everyone's mother and a 
doctor who's kind at heart.</i>

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.560
Enter.

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:37.820
Pardon me.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.930
Um, what do you need from me?

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:42.150
Oh, nothing.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.450
Is everything fine?

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:44.350
Yes.

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:47.120
Take care of yourself 
and don't work too hard.

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:47.820
Okay.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.820
If you ever need anything, let me know.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:53.190
Right.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.860
I received some rice buns.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:56.730
Want one?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.120
<b>Grandfather and 
Granddaughter</b>

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.220
Welcome back, Kyouka-chan.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:10.920
Hey, hey, Kyouka-chan, 
how's apartment life for you?

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:13.960
It may be a bit tight for two people, 
but you get used to it, don't you?

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:16.260
You even have a white tiger 
bodyguard, after all.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:19.250
Although this tiger probably 
couldn't handle a lady.

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:21.240
I heard all of that!

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.240
<i>What a strange person.</i>

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:24.860
Uh oh, I'm in trouble.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.900
<i>A roommate? Bodyguard?</i>

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.450
You're doing this on purpose!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.490
Not at all.

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.070
<i>No, he's my...</i>

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.010
You aren't making sense!

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:29.860
Sowwie.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.390
<i>To me, he's...</i>

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.570
See! I knew it!

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.700
<i>Staaare...</i>

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:36.000
<b>Staaare</b>

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:35.980
Wh-What? Kyouka-chan.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:40.050
You look shiny, Kunikida-kun.

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:41.310
It's finally over.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:43.640
Come see me if you ever get hurt.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:45.690
You should get checked out, too.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.260
No, I'll pass.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.670
It's about time for lunch, huh?

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.010
I'm starving.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.260
If you're hungry, I've got some sushi.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.010
Really?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:54.910
Of course.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.430
Another peaceful day, huh?

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.350
I think it's nice and lively, 
with so many different people.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.650
That's so grown-up!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.650
<b>Wan!</b>

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:06.410
Wan! Shorts

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.650
<b>Shorts</b>

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:19.910
<b>Sake   Wine   Whiskey</b>

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:19.910
<b>Drugstore</b>

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:19.910
Atsushi

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:14.140
Ch-Chuuya-san. Hello.

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:15.330
How've you been?

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:16.960
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:24.000
My name is Nakajima Atsushi.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:28.010
I've been involved in all kinds of incidents 
since joining the Armed Detective Agency.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:31.370
At the same time, I'm shocked by 
the many things Dazai-san does.

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.670
So, I've made a decision:

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:38.420
I, Nakajima Atsushi, will show that I can 
do anything when I put my mind to it.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.440
<b>Episode 37</b>

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.440
<b>Nakajima
 Atsushi's
 Plan</b>

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.470
<i>My plan goes like this:</i>

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.270
<b>Do something 
shocking and surprising</b>

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:45.530
<i>Do something shocking.</i>

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:47.320
<b>Surprise
 Dazai-san</b>

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.310
<i>Surprise Dazai-san.</i>

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:51.790
<i>The problem is that I don't 
know what, exactly, to do.</i>

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.610
<b>A huge problem</b>

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:53.800
<i>Let's ask...</i>

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.070
That's a waste of time.

00:07:56.260 --> 00:08:00.330
B-But don't you want to see 
Dazai-san's surprised face?

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.660
Whoa!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.330
<b>Whoa!</b>

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:03.440
I don't even want to see his face at all.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.000
Oh, why don't you put 
some poison in his food?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.350
Something <i>really</i> potent, please.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:11.120
Wouldn't he die?

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.460
He very well may.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:16.210
Of course you're not going to get 
anything out of Kunikida-kun.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:18.590
Do you have any ideas, Rampo-san?

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:21.180
What would shock the pants off Dazai-san?

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.570
Oh, all right.

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:25.920
I'll give some advice to my poor junior.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:26.990
Really?!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:30.480
What would shock Dazai-san is you 
not being surprised by what he does.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.510
That way, you won't be frustrated anymore,

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:36.560
and you won't have to surprise Dazai-san.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:37.610
I-I see...

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.670
<i>Have a calm mind, like the water's surface.</i>

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:41.330
Okay.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.510
I doubt you can do that, though.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.830
You can buy me ramune 
for the consulting fee.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:46.860
Special discount.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:50.380
<i>I don't think that fundamentally 
solves anything.</i>

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.370
Don't half-ass it.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.020
Make sure he's almost dead.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.660
Y-Yosano-sensei?!

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.260
You're getting revenge on Dazai, aren't you?

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.230
No, I'm not!

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:00.820
I just want to surprise him.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:03.110
I'll leave the treatment room free.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:06.900
I don't want revenge or anything like that.

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.270
<i>Come to think of it, though...</i>

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.640
<i>I left the orphanage,</i>

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:18.740
<i>ran into Dazai-san at the river, and then 
I joined the Armed Detective Agency...</i>

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.280
<i>What do I want to do to him?</i>

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:30.890
Oh, Dazai-san.

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:32.260
Atsushi-kun.

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:33.630
Hey...

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:34.810
What is it?

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.090
Here.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.300
For you.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.420
This is for all you've done for me.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.810
It's not much, but it's for you.

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:48.770
Thank you for everything, Dazai-san.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:53.930
Huh?

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.240
You did it, Atsushi!

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.770
Did you do it? Did you poison him?

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.510
Not bad, Atsushi-kun.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:03.030
I haven't done anything 
out of the ordinary...

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:08.630
Yokohama is peaceful indeed these days.

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:11.100
This is the fruit of your labors.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:13.040
Not that we've done anything.

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:16.920
Since the day you and I started 
the Armed Detective Agency,

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:21.760
we've gradually increased our numbers 
and grown to the size we are today.

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:27.370
Is this really how we should have ended it?

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:28.590
Why not?

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:30.430
We're stray dogs.

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:32.620
Wander with pride, young man.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:35.350
You're just trying to end 
it with a platitude.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.570
<b><i>Until we 
meet again</i></b>

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.570
Until we meet again.

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:38.850
I thought I was dead.
